{"id":"70dded22aaad5847","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination.md","title":"Consistency from Cut Elimination","display":"thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination — Consistency from Cut Elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination","aliases":["72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination"],"display":"thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination — Consistency from Cut Elimination","depends_on":[],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local derivation; background Ch.I §2.4; print36–42; PDF48–54","verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination — Consistency from Cut Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local derivation; background Ch.I §2.4; print36–42; PDF48–54"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_0,P_1\">\\(P_0,P_1\\)</span> 是同一语言中的合法证明集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:P_0\\cup P_1\\to Q\">\\(c:P_0\\cup P_1\\to Q\\)</span> 是结论函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in Q\">\\(b\\in Q\\)</span> 是固定矛盾结论。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_0\">\\(P_0\\)</span> 是无切基础演算的证明集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_1\">\\(P_1\\)</span> 是加入 Cut 后的证明集。已知切消性质 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in P_1\\ \\exists\\pi&#39;\\in P_0\\ (c(\\pi&#39;)=c(\\pi))\">\\(\\forall\\pi\\in P_1\\ \\exists\\pi&#39;\\in P_0\\ (c(\\pi&#39;)=c(\\pi))\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\notin c[P_0]\">\\(b\\notin c[P_0]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b\\notin c[P_1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b\\notin c[P_1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地推导：若存在 π∈P1 以 b 为结论，切消性质给出 π′∈P0 仍以 b 为结论，与假设矛盾。背景为第 I 章 §2.4，印刷 pp.36–42 / PDF pp.48–54。</p>\n<p>旧条把 CutFree 同时用作谓词和证明集合，并没有保证基础演算本身无切。现在把合法证明集合及“不存在无切矛盾证明”的必要前提直接声明，避免从切消单独推出任意理论的一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P_0,P_1","display":false},{"tex":"c:P_0\\cup P_1\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"P_0","display":false},{"tex":"P_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in P_1\\ \\exists\\pi'\\in P_0\\ (c(\\pi')=c(\\pi))","display":false},{"tex":"b\\notin c[P_0]","display":false},{"tex":"b\\notin c[P_1].","display":true}],"bytes":1408,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination|thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination — Consistency from Cut Elimination]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-107","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination — Consistency from Cut Elimination](72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination.md)"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination|thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination — Consistency from Cut Elimination]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-426","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-consistency-via-cut-elimination]]"}],"outgoing":[]}